# An unseen bite (FightSim.begin_bite): in a crowd, a bite begun from out of the
# player's sight is told longer and cued, by a machine's call from its bearing
# and a mark at the slate's edge on the side it comes from. Three cutters
# roused, one of them at the player's back; from above, then over the shoulder.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/unseen.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --give=knife:1 --held=knife --config=unharmed
coast calm
place open_coast
zoom 8
wait 0.6
spawn cutter
spawn cutter
spawn cutter
behind cutter
wait 0.3
shot 01-a-cutter-at-your-back-and-its-mark with mob:cutter

# The same crowd, over the shoulder: the one at the back is behind the lens.
wait 2.0
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
behind cutter
wait 0.3
shot 02-over-the-shoulder-the-mark-on-its-side with shoulder,mob:cutter
